            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tom Brown"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really good. I used all yellow squash and a cup of diced canned tomatoes instead of a fresh tomato (it's the dead of winter). I also used homemade baking mix. The recipe for it is on allrecipes. The pie reminds me a bit of corn pudding. But the dish is less sweet and the homemade baking mix added something to the fluffy lightness of the dish that storebought doesn't. Overall, simple to prepare, economical, and a non-guilty, tasty comfort food.",
            "datePublished": "2024-02-04T23:05:39.245Z"
